---
// FirstPersonCard
---

<div class="linked-image-hover w-full">
  <div
    class="w-[320px] relative flex aspect-2/3 flex-row overflow-hidden bg-base-100 border-6 border-gray-400"
  >
    <div class="border border-amber-200 w-1/5 flex items-start justify-center">
      <span
        class="[writing-mode:vertical-rl] rotate-180 whitespace-nowrap text-xs text-accent font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] px-2 py-1 font-['Inter']"
      >
        от первого лица
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-green-300 w-4/5 grid grid-rows-[5fr_7fr]">
      <div class="border border-blue-300 pt-2 pr-2">
        <h2
          class="font-old_standard leading-[1.15] text-base-content text-[22px] font-semibold"
        >
          Роман Должанский о том, как он попал в DAU Ильи Хржановского и сыграл
          самого себя.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-pink-400">
        <img
          src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/maag-60419.firebasestorage.app/o/authorsAvatars%2FnoBackground%2FRD_void.png?alt=media&token=37e6a83b-7d15-4dd2-9054-3556e535dd00"
          alt=""
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
